<title>SINGAPORE: Brunei raises price of November Seria Light.</title>
<headline>Brunei raises price of November Seria Light.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brunei has raised the price of its Seria Light crude by $1.40 per barrel for November to $26.20 from $24.80 in October, traders said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The November price of the Champion crude was set at $26.00 per barrel, up $1.40 from $24.60 in October.</p>
<p>Brunei set a provisional December price for Seria Light of $25.10 and a provisional price for Champion of $24.90, the traders said.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
</text>
